-         ┌────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┐
-         ▼                            ▼                            ▼
-  Discrete Curvature & Torsion   Gauss Solid-Angle Writhe   C-Beta Ribbon Geometry
-  - Segment: l_i = ||r_{i+1}-r_i|| - Van Oosterom (1983)     - v_beta = (r_CB - r_CA)/||...||
-  - Curvature: \kappa_i \in [0,\pi]  - Branch-cut free         - Glycine pseudo-CB bisector
